msgstr "出错"

msgid "File not found: %s"
msgstr "文件不存在：%s"

msgid "Free-form input: local paths and http/https/rtsp/rtmp/rtmps/hls/udp URLs are all accepted (the backend detects the scheme automatically, there is no mode switch). The candidates below are suggestions only - pick one or just type over it."
msgstr "可自由手填：本地路径与 http/https/rtsp/rtmp/rtmps/hls/udp 等 URL 均支持（后端自动识别，无模式开关）。下方为扫描到的候选，点选即填入，也可完全手打覆盖。"

msgid "HW decode"
msgstr "硬解"

