msgstr "总长未知"


msgid "Source codec"
msgstr "源编码"





msgid "H.264/H.265 are encoded by the hardware engine (zero copy, fast)"
msgstr "H.264/H.265 由硬件编码器完成（零拷贝，速度快）"




msgid "Sources are hardware-decoded (H.264/HEVC/VP8/VP9) and encoded by the H.264/H.265 hardware encoder - the output codecs are the only two this SoC encodes in hardware"
msgstr "源文件一律硬件解码（H.264/HEVC/VP8/VP9），再由 H.264/H.265 硬件编码器输出——这块 SoC 能硬件编码的只有这两种"

msgid "Unsupported encoder: %s (this SoC only has H.264/H.265 hardware encoders)"
msgstr "不支持的编码器：%s（这块 SoC 只有 H.264/H.265 硬件编码器）"
